### Create user (direct to user-service)
POST {{userService}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester",
  "email": "tester@example.com",
  "fullName": "Tester",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Create post (direct to post-service)
POST {{postService}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3,
  "title": "My post3",
  "content": "3initial content",
  "tags": "test"
}

###

### Warm cache: get post by id (direct to post-service)
GET {{postService}}/api/posts/3

###

### Warm cache: get all posts (direct to post-service)
GET {{postService}}/api/posts

###

### Update post (direct to post-service)
PUT {{postService}}/api/posts/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3,
  "title": "dsa title",
  "content": "3updated content"
}

###

### Get post by id after update (direct to post-service)
GET {{postService}}/api/posts/3

###

### Get all posts after update (direct to post-service)
GET {{postService}}/api/posts